{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Threshold of Judgment</strong> places you before a sentient gate between Heaven and Hell \u2014 the final trial of your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are dead, yet not gone. To escape eternal torment, you must answer <strong>15 questions</strong> posed by the Gatekeeper and his children \u2014 beings who judge truth, logic, and wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct answer brings you closer to <strong>Paradise</strong>... but a single mistake may open the gates of <i>eternal damnation</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 500 unique questions and riddles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Atmospheric 3D visuals and demonic voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings \u2014 Heaven, Hell, or the Underworld</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode with global and weekly leaderboard  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Achievements for each fate you reach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinite replayability \u2014 knowledge is your only salvation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Gate. Speak your truth. Cross the Threshold \u2014 or be consumed by it.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ascended","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114610/15b5f40596bf53c8e3ae4d623cdab33ad2e69d3c.jpg"},{"name":"Condemned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114610/b568addeb68d05234c207700b1c938268e417487.jpg"},{"name":"The Forgotten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114610/657b0245a44c91e9d8318c61a440d232e0f084d8.jpg"},{"name":"The Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114610